      "id": "claim_7844cb54c13742fa9472237d9e0148c0",
      "statement": "Before launching work, the entrypoint requires OCM and kubeconfig paths to be task-scoped mounts that are not EFS/NFS-backed, prepares them with sre:sre ownership and mode 0700, then runs the requested process as sre in the background while the root shell blocks on wait to retain signal handling.",
