      "id": "claim_170a90da4a6943b9a5bb4fb2019c2a64",
      "statement": "The current Containerfile's final stage ships only a single pinned oc build directly at /usr/local/bin/oc and does not populate /opt/openshift/<version>/oc, so the entrypoint's OC_VERSION-driven 'alternatives --set oc' version switch is presently a no-op that falls through to its 'using default' warning unless that directory is populated by some other means.",
