    {
      "id": "claim_1f32096c95ca43cd9ebf65165725879e",
      "statement": "The entrypoint runs an unprivileged skill-reconciliation helper (/usr/local/libexec/rosa-boundary-skill-sync.sh) as sre, started via start_skill_reconciler after the skeleton copy and controlled by BOUNDARY_SKILLS_ENABLED (default on); the helper symlinks each published collection's skills from /opt/rosa-content/rosa-claude-plugins into ~/.claude/skills under boundary--<collection>--<skill> names on a configurable interval, removing only the links it manages when a skill is retired.",
